<title>JAPAN: Itochu to post 30.3 bln yen special loss in 96/97.</title>
<headline>Itochu to post 30.3 bln yen special loss in 96/97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Itochu Corp said on Tuesday that it would post an extraordinary loss of 30.3 billion yen in the 1996/97 fiscal year due to the devaluation of collateral it holds on loans extended to real estate firms.</p>
</text>
